{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1srDSMVMMhqq9FfNmnX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with a PASS at 0.5 confidence. Two quest-log observations are unresolved, and the developer could not reproduce either one with the steps I gave.\n\n**Filed reports:** I filed two. Both were answered \"could not reproduce with the steps given.\"\n- **Smithing I missing:** it is in the precondition as completed, but no quest tab lists it.\n- **Iron Quota:** on the Mining Guild board it shows \"Requires Guild Level 1\" with no Completed marker, while the precondition lists it as completed. Copper Run on the same board does show Completed.\n\nBoth may come from a mismatch between the test save and the precondition rather than a build defect. I left them unresolved.\n\n**Checked and looked correct:**\n- **Sell Old Gear:** the candidate list and total match the rows. It only offers duplicates when Keep-one is on.\n- **Sell Junk:** the list and total match the rows with Keep-one on and off. Cooking, Fletching and Crafting recipes do not use Feather, Cowhide, Wool, Pumpkin or Tomato, so the offered junk is consistent.\n- **Keep-one toggle:** its state persisted after leaving and re-entering the shop. I set it back to off at the end.\n- **Buy sheet:** +10 gives the right total, Max gives 366,841 for 2.5M, and Cancel leaves coins and stock unchanged.\n- **Quest log:** all six tabs, the Completed markers on Gathering, Hide completed, Go to Skill, and rotation to landscape and back.\n\n**Not filed:** in landscape, the \"Go to Skill\" labels run up against the system navigation bar. This may be the emulator's nav overlay, so I did not file it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1300, "cache_read_input_tokens": 183002, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemera